{
  "slug": "scan-modules",
  "name": "Scan Modules",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Scan and cache project module structure for fast Claude context loading. Use /scan-modules:scan-modules to index your codebase, then Claude auto-loads the cache each session. Supports incremental updates via git diff and auto-update via post-commit hook. Works with Swift, TypeScript, Python, Go, and Rust.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `auto-context` (IMPORTANT: Use this proactively at the START of every conversation to load the project module cache)\n- **Commands** (1): `scan-modules`\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install scan-modules@claude-community` from `fengzhyuan/scan-modules-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
